        },
        {
          "text": " “Kholele Naikara eye Bisali eye bibiaamo bie khunyoa bie kimilimo kiowo, kie bikesa bie mu mukuunda mwowo. Kholele naikara eye binywa kumwiiko ne kulikho kuwa, ne olikho obuusia khukhwama mu mukuunda bibiaamo bie kimilimo kiowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
