    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Okhateekha limeeme namwe embusi emeeme mu mabeele ka maawe tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kamasuubisia ne kamalaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lola, ndaruma Malaika ebweeni wenywe amuliinde khu lukeendo mala amwosie abuundu niio murekekheele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muulile lundi mu murekeeresie nga ne aloma. Mukhamukholela sileka tawe, sikila mwakhola murio se acha khumubeela kamabi kenywe tawe. Ali ne kamaani kase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali mwaba barekeerefu khurekeeresia niko aloma, mala mukhole koosi niko emuboolela, aba ndaba omusiku khu basiku benywe ne khubiila abo bamubiila enywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika wase alamurangirira mala amuyile enywe mu sibala sie Baamori, Bahiti, Baperisi, Bakanaani, Baifi, ne Bayebusi. Ne ndabunia babaandu bano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhenamila bawele babwe namwe mukhabasaaya tawe, lundi mukhaloonda kimiima kiabwe tawe. Ne kakhali mwonakake bawele babwe ne khutechula chinjeko che bawele babwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhoya mukholele ese, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe, ne ese ndabiita chikhabi biakhulia bienywe ne kameechi ne khurusiao bulwaale akari wenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbao omukhasi ocha khukhobokha, namwe abe omukuumba mu sibala sienywe tawe. Ndamukhola enywe mu menye lukali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ndara bireengo mu baandu baali ebweeni wenywe mala ngoyanisie babaandu nibo mukhakaanane. Khakhole basiku benywe boosi bamwilukhe enywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khare bireengo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23.28",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "khare bireengo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "namwe ekharume bing'eng'e mu basiku benywe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mu Baibi, Bakanaani ne Baiti mala bamwilukhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se nja khubatimania mu mwiiko mulala tawe. Nakhola ndio, sibala sinyala sianjukhwa, ne chisolo che mundaa chinyala chatasikha mala chamuminya enywe bukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali khabaoone sia batiiti, khukhwola nga ne mulitasikha mwoole munyala mwabukula sibala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khareeo chinjakha che sibala sienywe chaame khu nyanja eya Shamu khukhwola khu nyanja eye Bafilisiti, lundi khukhwama mu sichiimi khukhwola khu luuchi lwa Efurati. Khare bamenywa be mu sibala esio mu bunyali bwenywe mala mucha khubaoona barure ebweeni wenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se mukhoya mwakholakho endakaano yosi yosi nabo namwe ne bawele babwe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se bakhoyeele bamenye mu maloba kenywe tawe. Bakhola bario bakila mwakholela ese bubwoni sikila mwaba ne mukholela bawele babwe, ng'ali kucha khuba kumureko khwinywe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
